  "fullDescription": "Spooky Cute Halloween Animal Clipart Bundle\n\nAdd a touch of whimsical charm to your autumn crafts with this Spooky Cute Halloween Animal Clipart Bundle! This adorable collection features 6 unique, high-quality illustrations perfect for kid-friendly Halloween designs, trick-or-treat tote bags, party invitations, stickers, and seasonal apparel.\n\nThis cute and creepy collection includes:\n-A kawaii pink Vampire-Axolotl with a jack-o’-lantern bucket.\n-A playful Xolo-Mummy (Xoloitcuintle) wrapped in bandages.\n-A magical Witch-Cat flying on a broomstick.\n-A cozy Pumpkin-Capybara wearing a festive pumpkin costume holding a lantern.\n-A whimsical Pirate-Frog sitting on a toadstool with a treasure map.\n-A funny Ghost-Opossum dressed as a sheet ghost, hanging by its tail.\n\nBring a fun, non-scary vibe to your October projects with these enchanting little critters!\nWhat’s Included:\n6 High-resolution files ([PNG with transparent backgrounds, SVG, and PSD).\n4500 x 5400 px, 300 DPI.",
